course: dictionary
lesson: 165
title: A plant with spiky leaves
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: You can work out a new word by reading the words around it. In «Wild bananas, durians and agave plants are pollinated by bats», the word agave comes in a list of plants, so it must be a plant too.
explain: The dictionary says an agave is a plant with thick, spiky, sword-shaped leaves. Those leaves are thick because the plant stores water in them, which helps it live in hot, dry places.
explain: The word also appears in food. Agave syrup is a sweet syrup made from the plant, so when you see «agave syrup» on a label, think of a sweetener, not a sword.
fact: An agave is a plant with thick, spiky, sword-shaped leaves.
fact: Agaves grow in hot, dry places, mainly in Mexico and the south-west USA.
fact: Agave syrup is a sweet syrup made from the agave plant.
fact: Bats carry pollen between agave flowers, which helps the plant make seeds.
fact: Bat flowers are pale, strong-smelling and open at night.
exercise: What is an agave? | *A plant with thick, spiky leaves | A kind of rock found in deserts | An animal that flies at night | A sweet drink made from milk
exercise: What is agave syrup? | *A sweet syrup made from the agave plant | A kind of bat food sold in shops | A spiky leaf used to make swords | Salty water from the sea
exercise: «Wild bananas, durians and agave plants are pollinated by bats.» Which animal pollinates the agave in this sentence? | Fish | *Bats | Dogs | Bees only
test: Where do agave plants grow best? | Wet, rainy forests with no sun | Cold, snowy mountains | Deep under the sea | *Hot, dry places such as Mexico
test: «Some bats feed on fruit and nectar and carry pollen between flowers.» What do these bats do for agave plants? | *Carry pollen between their flowers | Turn their leaves into spikes | Eat their leaves | Make their syrup
exam: Which sentence about the agave is true? | It is a bat that feeds only on fish | *It is a plant with thick, spiky leaves that stores water | It is a kind of sweet fruit that grows in the sea | It is a rock that is found in cold places
